    "blurb": "Sign Documents Digitally With Camunda",
    "overview": "Maximize Efficiency with our Camunda Connector for DocuSign- Seamlessly automate DocuSign operations within Camunda BPM. Optimize your document workflows, from electronic signatures to document management, and boost productivity. Experience seamless integration and streamline your digital transactions today!",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
