  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Unleash Effortless Docusign-Camunda Integration",
    "splashDescription": "The Camunda Connector for DocuSign empowers users to seamlessly integrate DocuSign functionalities into their Camunda workflows. With this connector, you can automate the entire range of DocuSign operations, from document signing to managing users, all within the Camunda BPM platform. This integration streamlines and enhances your business process, offering a powerful solution for managing digital document transactions with ease and efficiency.",
